# Architecture Overview

## System Purpose

This system automates the production of a weekly operations summary report. The source material is a Word document containing raw operational updates from multiple sites. The output is a structured, formatted Word document with three sections, delivered automatically when the source document is deposited.

---

## High-Level Flow

```
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│  SOURCE DOCUMENT deposited to SharePoint trigger folder │
└─────────────────────────┬───────────────────────────────┘
                          │ triggers
                          ▼
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│           POWER AUTOMATE FLOW                           │
│                                                         │
│  Step 1 ── SharePoint trigger fires                     │
│                                                         │
│  Step 2 ── Execute Document Reader Agent and wait       │
│            Input:  filename (via message)               │
│            Output: SiteList, HyperlinkInventory,        │
│                    REPORT_DATE (JSON)                   │
│                                                         │
│  Step 3 ── Compose: strip code fences from JSON         │
│  Step 4 ── Parse JSON: extract three variables          │
│  Step 5 ── Set variable: REPORT_DATE                    │
│  Step 6 ── Initialize variable: SITE_SUMMARIES = ""     │
│                                                         │
│  Step 7 ── Apply to each site in SiteList (loop)        │
│            ├── Execute Site Summarizer Agent and wait   │
│            │   Input:  site name                        │
│            │   Output: SiteSummary (plain text)         │
│            └── Append SiteSummary to SITE_SUMMARIES     │
│                                                         │
│  Step 8 ── Execute Executive Summary Writer and wait    │
│            Input:  SITE_SUMMARIES                       │
│            Output: EXECUTIVE_SUMMARY                    │
│                                                         │
│  Step 9 ── Execute Appendix Generator and wait          │
│            Input:  SiteList, HyperlinkInventory         │
│            Output: APPENDIX_CONTENT                     │
│                                                         │
│  Step 10 ─ Populate Word template                       │
│            Maps: REPORT_DATE, EXECUTIVE_SUMMARY,        │
│                  SITE_SUMMARIES, APPENDIX_CONTENT       │
│                                                         │
│  Step 11 ─ SharePoint: Create file (timestamped name)   │
│  Step 12 ─ SharePoint: Get file properties (URL)        │
│  Step 13 ─ Send email notification with URL             │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

